00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.459 align:start position:0%
 
hey everyone my name is Jake and I've  been playing Animal Crossing for the  past month now and while I have really  been enjoying it there are some things  that are missing so I figured I'd come  with a list of some of the buildings and  characters that I have not seen yet now  I do in a preface that Animal Crossing  is meant to be played for long stretches  of time so they could just not be in the  game yet maybe they show up as you play  or Nintendo could add them through  updates but anyway let's get to it so  the first one up is the art museum in  previous Animal Crossing games there was  a wing of your museum dedicated to  artwork and you can get artwork through  a character named crazy red who would  show up at your town every now and then  and basically he'd sell you things for a  very high price and you'd have to  determine whether or not the artwork was  real or counterfeit I haven't seen crazy  red at all I haven't found any artwork  and so far even though I've donated a  good amount to the museum I haven't  gotten any upgrade for an art museum the  next one here's the roost which was  always a personal favorite of mine it  was basically a coffee shop run by a  pigeon named Brewster now I've been  playing for about a month now I've seen  no signs of him or coffee or anything I  feel like this is something that will  come later through an update at least  that's what I'm hoping for because I  always thought Brewster and the roost  was such a staple of the Animal Crossing  series the next one I have here's dr.  shrunk in previous games he would teach  you different reactions however since  now animals will come up to you and  teach you those reactions I don't really  see why he'd be in the game I doubt  you'll run into him at all maybe they'll  add him eventually but I think he's just  kind of been cut the next one here is  mr. Resetti which is kind of interesting  because he is kind of in the game right  if you call Rescue Services it sounds  like he's the one on the other end who  will help you get out of a sticky  situation I actually have only called  rescue services once mostly because I  wanted to see if I'd be able to see mr.  Resetti  I didn't so I don't think he's in the  game maybe I'll show up eventually but  who knows Jai roids are another thing  that's missing in this game so  technically there is Lloyd of which  whenever you build a bridge or an  incline you donate funds to him and he's  a very good character I do like Lloyd  quite a bit but I haven't seen any guy  roads buried or anything like that it  seems like as of right now gyros are  just not in the game the next character  I have here is Cap'n who would basically  paddle you out to your deserted island  and sing you a tune on your way I don't  think he's in this game because the  Dodos kind of stole his job right  they'll fly you out to deserted islands  where you can catch bugs and fish  pick fruit and what not so I don't think  we'll see him in the same capacity as  before maybe he'll show up as a visitor  at some point through an update the next  character missing we have here is  tortimer now at the beginning of new  leaf he kind of transitioned a lot of  his responsibilities off to you and more  or less retired which is good friend you  know it was getting kind of old however  we haven't seen him at all in New  Horizons I remember during the direct a  lot of people were theorizing that the  tombstone up on the cliff could have  been tortimer that's definitely not the  case though because we found out that  you can just place objects that look  like tombs don't start your Island if  you really want to speaking of Mayors  one thing that's not New Horizons are  ordinances ordinances a new leaf  basically let you tweak how your Island  work two big ones were the late night  and early bird ordinance which basically  changed the hours of all your shops so  if you are gone all day working or at  school or whatever it might be you could  change it to the late night ordinance oh  you could still check out all your shops  and whatnot and see what's available the  next building that's missing is shampoo  DeLand Animal Crossing new horizons you  can customize your hair style and color  through a mirror so it doesn't really  need to be in this game that still begs  the question of what happened to Harriet  who knows maybe we'll find out one day  so the next one I have here is perfect  fruit now this could still be in the  game it could just be that we haven't  found it or we haven't met the  requirements to grow perfect fruit but  new leaf perfect fruit basically was  just fruit that sold for a lot at the  stores there were different ways you  could get it like I said we don't think  it's the new horizons but we haven't  seen it yet maybe when your town hits  five stars perfect fruit start showing  up or something like that  the next character we have here is  Katrina the fortune teller basically  she'd show up on your town and give you  a reading for a small fee she'd tell you  ways to improve your luck and whatnot so  far I haven't seen her so the next  building we have here is the police  station which so far hasn't shown up  which personally I guess I'm kind of  okay with but I do really miss copper  and Booker I thought they were a great  pair and I think they'd add a lot to new  horizons if they were in it so fingers  crossed that one day they will you know  at least swing by our island and say hi  the next character we have here is Rover  which I always thought was kind of a  mascot for Animal Crossing but I guess  not because so far we haven't seen Rover  an animal crossing new horizons in  previous games Rover would more or less  just set up your town for you ask you  where you were headed there you could  name your town and you could answer some  of Rovers questions and that would  determine your looks the next character  we have here is the fashion superstar  Gracie and preview  animal crossing games she would show up  to your town and she would more or less  judge whatever you're wearing and seems  like that role has kind of been shifted  over to label who does show up every now  and then on your town and she'll have  you dress a certain way that she'll  recommend and if you do it she'll give  you a tailors voucher which lets you  pick out anything you want at the able  sisters a building that we probably  won't ever see is the post office mostly  because a lot of those responsibilities  have been shifted over to the Dodos at  the airport but before there was a  dedicated post office building that you  could go to and that's where you had  send letters and do other things like  that it was run by two characters Pelle  and Phyllis I thought they were great  characters haven't seen him so far but  apart from that you could also talk to  Pete who would deliver mail to all the  residents the next building we have here  is retail which was introduced in Animal  Crossing new leaf but is not a new  horizon so far it was run by recent  Cyrus and basically you sell your stuff  to them they could reupholster furniture  eventually but it seems like that's kind  of been replaced by the DIY  customization options in the game  another character here which is a little  bit of a weird one is Joan because even  though we haven't seen her she has been  mentioned in the game most of her  responsibilities have been transitioned  over to Daisy Mae but Daisy Mae has  mentioned Joan so Joan is still alive  and kick'n the next thing we have here  is the happy home showcase which was run  by Digby a lot of what you did and a  happy home showcase was linked to  streetpassed so it kind of makes sense  that that's not in the game I hope maybe  down the line with an update they find  another way to integrate the happy home  showcase because that was a good way to  you know share what your house looked  like with other people anyway those are  some of the biggest things that we  haven't seen an animal crossing new  horizons yet if you found any of this  stuff please please please let us know  because I would love to get it on my  town if there's other things that we  didn't talk about that you miss please  let us know in the comments below and  thank you so much for watching  [Music]  [Applause]

